{"title":"Setup","markdown":{"yaml":{"title":"Setup","editor":"visual","output":{"html_document":{"toc":true,"toc_float":true,"number_sections":false}}},"headingText":"1. Install and Load Packages and Data","containsRefs":false,"markdown":"\n\n```{r setup, include=FALSE}\nknitr::opts_chunk$set(echo = TRUE, message = FALSE, warning = FALSE)\n```\n\n\nTo install the following packages on your computer you will need to use:\n\n```{r setup2}\n#| exec: false\n#| eval: false \ninstall.packages()\n```\n\nor\n\n```{r setup3}\n#| exec: false\n#| eval: false \nif (!require(\"BiocManager\", quietly = TRUE)) \n  install.packages(\"BiocManager\") \nBiocManager::install()\n```\n\nNote: The \\#'s throughout the file are comments, if you remove the \\# from the line in the code chunk you can run that line.\n\n```{r load-packages, message=FALSE, warning=FALSE, paged.print=FALSE}\n#(!require(\"BiocManager\", quietly = TRUE))\n#    install.packages(\"BiocManager\")\n#BiocManager::install()\n\n#install.packages(\"vcfR\")\nlibrary(vcfR)\nlibrary(adegenet)\nlibrary(poppr)\nlibrary(ape)\nlibrary(pegas)\nlibrary(ggplot2)\nlibrary(dplyr)\nlibrary(reshape2)\nlibrary(ggtree)\nlibrary(viridis)\nlibrary(dartR.base)\nlibrary(hierfstat)\nlibrary(tidyr)\nlibrary(sf)\nlibrary(rnaturalearth)\nlibrary(rnaturalearthdata)\nlibrary(scales)\nlibrary(purrr)\n\n# OR: \nsource(\"packages.R\")\n\n```\n\n```{r load_files}\n\n# Extended metadata with sites, coordinates, and DR mutations\nmeta <- read.table(\"data/metadata_samples.txt\", header = TRUE, sep = \"\\t\", stringsAsFactors = FALSE)\n\n# load the African data and the Southeast Asia data. You will need both of these to find where the imported cases are.\nAFR <- read.vcfR(\"data/AFR_180snp_DR.vcf\")\nSEA <- read.vcfR(\"data/SEA_180snp_DR.vcf\")\n\n```\n\n::: {.callout-note collapse=\"true\"}\n## Click to see SEA dataset\n\n```{r}\n#| echo: false\nSEA\n```\n:::\n\n::: {.callout-note collapse=\"true\"}\n## Click to see AFR dataset\n\n```{r}\n#| echo: false\nAFR\n```\n:::\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":"\n\n```{r setup, include=FALSE}\nknitr::opts_chunk$set(echo = TRUE, message = FALSE, warning = FALSE)\n```\n\n## 1. Install and Load Packages and Data\n\nTo install the following packages on your computer you will need to use:\n\n```{r setup2}\n#| exec: false\n#| eval: false \ninstall.packages()\n```\n\nor\n\n```{r setup3}\n#| exec: false\n#| eval: false \nif (!require(\"BiocManager\", quietly = TRUE)) \n  install.packages(\"BiocManager\") \nBiocManager::install()\n```\n\nNote: The \\#'s throughout the file are comments, if you remove the \\# from the line in the code chunk you can run that line.\n\n```{r load-packages, message=FALSE, warning=FALSE, paged.print=FALSE}\n#(!require(\"BiocManager\", quietly = TRUE))\n#    install.packages(\"BiocManager\")\n#BiocManager::install()\n\n#install.packages(\"vcfR\")\nlibrary(vcfR)\nlibrary(adegenet)\nlibrary(poppr)\nlibrary(ape)\nlibrary(pegas)\nlibrary(ggplot2)\nlibrary(dplyr)\nlibrary(reshape2)\nlibrary(ggtree)\nlibrary(viridis)\nlibrary(dartR.base)\nlibrary(hierfstat)\nlibrary(tidyr)\nlibrary(sf)\nlibrary(rnaturalearth)\nlibrary(rnaturalearthdata)\nlibrary(scales)\nlibrary(purrr)\n\n# OR: \nsource(\"packages.R\")\n\n```\n\n```{r load_files}\n\n# Extended metadata with sites, coordinates, and DR mutations\nmeta <- read.table(\"data/metadata_samples.txt\", header = TRUE, sep = \"\\t\", stringsAsFactors = FALSE)\n\n# load the African data and the Southeast Asia data. You will need both of these to find where the imported cases are.\nAFR <- read.vcfR(\"data/AFR_180snp_DR.vcf\")\nSEA <- read.vcfR(\"data/SEA_180snp_DR.vcf\")\n\n```\n\n::: {.callout-note collapse=\"true\"}\n## Click to see SEA dataset\n\n```{r}\n#| echo: false\nSEA\n```\n:::\n\n::: {.callout-note collapse=\"true\"}\n## Click to see AFR dataset\n\n```{r}\n#| echo: false\nAFR\n```\n:::\n"},"formats":{"html":{"identifier":{"display-name":"HTML","target-format":"html","base-format":"html"},"execute":{"fig-width":7,"fig-height